{
    "title": "Hide and Seek for Minecraft",
    "description": "Do you play minecraft daily and want something completely new? Have you tried a lot of mcpe maps and want something original and unforgettable? Do you often play minecraft pocket edition with your friends and are looking for new maps for mcpe, thanks to which your pastime will become many times more interesting and exciting? Then try hide and seek cards in minecraft. These mcpe maps look very nice and they are also made in such a way that you will never get bored playing hide and seek.\r\n\r\nThe essence of the hide and seek map for minecraft is very simple. One or more players, after a certain time, are looking for other people who must hide within the minecraft map. Hidden players win if no one has found them in the allotted time, otherwise the leading players win. The rules of this game are very simple and understandable for every player, and because of the large size and interesting structure of the map for mcpe, each game will be different from the previous one, and you can always choose an unexpected place for yourself to hide from the evil host.\r\n\r\nYou can greatly diversify the hide and seek gaming experience if you download skins for minecraft, which will give you special abilities. For example, a land skin for minecraft will allow you to move faster and climb some walls, thanks to which you can discover completely new places on the map. The water skin will give you the ability to swim faster and breathe for a long time underwater, so there is a great opportunity to hide from the leading player. Thanks to the lava skin, you can walk on lava for a short time without taking damage, which will be very useful in some parts of the map, and also help you reach places that others cannot get to. Also, camouflage skins for minecraft will allow you to hide from the eyes of the leading player in some places, thanks to which you will get a great advantage. You can download these and other skins for boys from us.\r\n\r\nAlso hide and seek maps can be used to play hunger games for minecraft pe. Everything is very simple here, at the very beginning, the players scatter in different directions of the map and try to find the best possible objects that are randomly scattered around the map, in order to eventually win, destroying all opponents. In this mode, everyone is for himself and you can only rely on your skills and luck.\r\nWe also have many maps available for minecraft, for example:\r\n\u2022 skyblock cards\r\n\u2022 maps for racing\r\n\u2022 bedwars cards\r\n\u2022 arena maps\r\n\u2022 one block map\r\n\u2022 survival on the island\r\n\u2022 capture of the base\r\n\u2022 hunger games maps\r\n\r\nYou can download these maps for minecraft and many others that will make survival in minecraft much more interesting and hardcore from us, in just a couple of clicks. All you need to play them is minecraft pe.\r\n\r\nThis is an unofficial application for Minecraft Pocket Edition. This application is not affiliated in any way with Mojang AB. The Minecraft Name, the Minecraft Brand and the Minecraft Assets are all property of Mojang AB or their respectful owner. All rights reserved. In accordance with http://account.mojang.com/documents/brand_guidelines",
    "descriptionHTML": "Do you play minecraft daily and want something completely new? Have you tried a lot of mcpe maps and want something original and unforgettable? Do you often play minecraft pocket edition with your friends and are looking for new maps for mcpe, thanks to which your pastime will become many times more interesting and exciting? Then try hide and seek cards in minecraft. These mcpe maps look very nice and they are also made in such a way that you will never get bored playing hide and seek.<br><br>The essence of the hide and seek map for minecraft is very simple. One or more players, after a certain time, are looking for other people who must hide within the minecraft map. Hidden players win if no one has found them in the allotted time, otherwise the leading players win. The rules of this game are very simple and understandable for every player, and because of the large size and interesting structure of the map for mcpe, each game will be different from the previous one, and you can always choose an unexpected place for yourself to hide from the evil host.<br><br>You can greatly diversify the hide and seek gaming experience if you download skins for minecraft, which will give you special abilities. For example, a land skin for minecraft will allow you to move faster and climb some walls, thanks to which you can discover completely new places on the map. The water skin will give you the ability to swim faster and breathe for a long time underwater, so there is a great opportunity to hide from the leading player. Thanks to the lava skin, you can walk on lava for a short time without taking damage, which will be very useful in some parts of the map, and also help you reach places that others cannot get to. Also, camouflage skins for minecraft will allow you to hide from the eyes of the leading player in some places, thanks to which you will get a great advantage. You can download these and other skins for boys from us.<br><br>Also hide and seek maps can be used to play hunger games for minecraft pe. Everything is very simple here, at the very beginning, the players scatter in different directions of the map and try to find the best possible objects that are randomly scattered around the map, in order to eventually win, destroying all opponents. In this mode, everyone is for himself and you can only rely on your skills and luck.<br>We also have many maps available for minecraft, for example:<br>\u2022 skyblock cards<br>\u2022 maps for racing<br>\u2022 bedwars cards<br>\u2022 arena maps<br>\u2022 one block map<br>\u2022 survival on the island<br>\u2022 capture of the base<br>\u2022 hunger games maps<br><br>You can download these maps for minecraft and many others that will make survival in minecraft much more interesting and hardcore from us, in just a couple of clicks. All you need to play them is minecraft pe.<br><br>This is an unofficial application for Minecraft Pocket Edition. This application is not affiliated in any way with Mojang AB. The Minecraft Name, the Minecraft Brand and the Minecraft Assets are all property of Mojang AB or their respectful owner. All rights reserved. In accordance with http://account.mojang.com/documents/brand_guidelines",
